OL,3,GNEWSAMurder victim was 'loved by
OL,4,Aeveryone', say family
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a woman who was found
OL,7,Fdead in Darlington has described her as
OL,8,Fbeing kind-hearted and somebody who
OL,9,Fwould do anything for anyone.
OL,11,FLeanne Park, who was pronounced dead at
OL,12,Fan address in Parkgate on Wednesday,
OL,13,Fwas said to have been the "best mam,
OL,14,Fnana, daughter and friend we could wish
OL,15,Ffor".
OL,17,FDurham Constabulary said its
OL,18,Finvestigation remained ongoing, with a
OL,19,F44-year-old man who was arrested on
OL,20,Fsuspicion of murder remaining in
OL,21,Fcustody.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
